<p>Haye sakina.. haye sakina..<br> Kehti thi ro roke baali sakina<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Duao'n mein mere asar aagaya hai<br> jo manga tha maine idhar aagaya hai<br> muqaddar ka suraj nazar aagaya hai<br> andhere gaye kya diyo ko jalana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>2. Mere bhai sab khwaab pure hue hai<br> mere baba zindaa'n ke dar pe khade hai<br> ye maana jo bhai ke sadmein bade hai<br> mai sojaungi banke tum na jagana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>3. Wo jab muh pe muh rakhke mujhko jagaye<br> sakina sakina woh kehke bulaye<br> wo godi mei lekar jo dil se lagaye<br> mere zakhmi kaano ko unse chupana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>4. Ye kaisa yaha'n inqelab aagaya hai<br> andhera gaya aftaab aagaya hai<br> mere khat ka khoya jawaab aagaya hai<br> khushi ka meri kuch nahi hai thikana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>5. Mere dil ki dhadkan badhi jaa rahi hai<br> jo aati nahi thi hawa aa rahi hai<br> ye kehte hue ab hayaa aa rahi hai<br> khudara na shimr e laee'n ko batana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>6. Bus ik aarzu hai mere bhai sunle<br> agar koi zanjeer e darr ko na khole<br> bohot dheere dheere, bohot haule haule<br> tu ghazi ko aawaaz dekar bulana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>7. Jab aayegi zindaa'n mein unki sawari<br> to jee jayegi ye musibat ki maari<br> sunaungi mai dukh unhe baari baari<br> kahungi ab aaye ho jaana kahi'n naa<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>8. Achanak andhero se ek shor uttha<br> to sajjad ne jaake bachhi se pucha<br> ye tumne sakina koi khwaab dekha<br> wo boli haqiqat ko mat khwaab kehna<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p> 
<p>9. Rehan o raza kuch bhi abid na bole<br> kaha kya kaha mere baba ne tumse<br> kaha kuch nahi dekh kar ro diye the<br> pukare bus ab tumko hai saath jaana<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai<br> zindaa'n ke darr ko khulwa do bhaiyya<br> baba mujhe lene aa gaye hai..(2)</p>